{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you're good at spotting images and solving captchas? Join Doma, a curious little cat who's just started training to become a detective! Help Doma take on picture-matching challenges to prove your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game, simple and quick gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 photo categories to explore, with 9 fun photos in each one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a challenge? Try the black &amp; white mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastered all the photos? Test your speed in timer mode and set a new record!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.poster.avif?t=1759227963\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.webm?t=1759227963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/extras/c81fa7167fdb3615313064fa52cf47ac.mp4?t=1759227963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690390?t=1759227963","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/304b7aa1f41dfa1c09a558c3ee8c1c8c8c230f00/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759227963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/70da073716994860e3e0b773f28d9c0e5ce7d550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759227963","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690390/70da073716994860e3e0b773f28d9c0e5ce7d550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759227963","catego